1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,399
[SPEAKER_00] Ekipa, dobro večer i dobrodošli u Novi Čušpajs.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:15,039
[SPEAKER_00] Većerašnja gošća je ugledna psihologica, doktor psihologije kliničke, antropolog, pisac, autorica nekoliko knjiga, gospođa Mila Alečković iz Beograda.

3
00:00:15,359 --> 00:00:20,719
[SPEAKER_00] Gospodža Mila, dobro večer, hvala vam što ste pristali i dobro nam došli.

4
00:00:20,879 --> 00:00:21,920
[SPEAKER_00] Eto, online je ali.

5
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,600
[SPEAKER_01] Dobro vas naša, hvala vama na pozivu.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:40,320
